                  <line class="line-v" x1="7" y1="2" x2="7" y2="12"></line>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-row-content">
              <p>The statutory government fee is &pound;4,500 (₹4,500) per class for individuals, startups, and registered MSMEs (50% concession), and ₹9,000 for standard corporate applicants. Professional advisory charges are quoted separately and transparently upfront.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
